<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per</p>
<p>dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after</p>
<p>75.7040 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 2		  July 1</p>
<p> High			     75.9020		 75.7050</p>
<p> Low				75.7602		 75.6000</p>
<p> Open			     75.8000		 75.6000</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.7040</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    5.905		   2.160</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
